# Visual-regression snapshots are COMMITTED, deliberately.
#
# They were ignored as "auto-generated", which made the suite assert nothing
# where it counted: a clean checkout has no snapshots, so every test wrote one
# and passed - 128 comparisons against files created seconds earlier. The only
# machine they ever compared anything on was a developer's, against whatever it
# last generated, so they failed on every deliberate component change and
# succeeded in CI regardless.
#
# A baseline is generated once and then reviewed. Regenerate by deleting the
# file and re-running; the diff is the point.
/__snapshots__
/packages/stx/test/integration/temp-integration
/examples/unified-chat/.stx
/packages/stx/test/cli/temp-cli
/packages/stx/test/out
